Subject: [PATCH] compat: include standard boolean constants before curses

The generated ncurses header supplies its configured bool ABI type but may
not provide C99 true/false macros. Include stdbool.h first, so those macros
remain available while curses retains its public NCURSES_BOOL definition.

--- a/src/iptraf-ng-compat.h
+++ b/src/iptraf-ng-compat.h
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 #include <errno.h>
 #include <ctype.h>
 #include <netdb.h>
+#include <stdbool.h>
 #include <curses.h>
 #include <panel.h>
 #include <assert.h>
